  "problems": [
   "translations: The English translation 'I can't bear to wait any longer' uses 'bear' instead of 'endure', which is acceptable, but the Russian translation 'Я больше не могу выносить это ожидание' adds 'это ожидание' (this waiting), which is not present in the Danish 'at vente' (to wait). The Danish is a general 'to wait', not 'this waiting'. The Russian should be 'Я больше не могу выносить ожидание' or 'Я не могу выдержать ожидания' to be faithful.",
   "adjudicator: The Russian translation adds 'это' (this), which is not in the Danish 'at vente', making it less faithful to the original sentence."
  ]
 },
